 "note": "Each home hangs off a Hub5 star; the stars face each other across a rotor (half-turn symmetry). The rotor joins north / south (r1: the stars' long top / bottom spokes) or west / east (r2: their inner spokes). A T-45 on each star's back spoke tilts the home off-axis, so the two stars spin like a pinwheel. Flex S-bridges close the outer arcs. [KEEP edit 2026-11-11: centre rotor -> switch (same decks per state); the two outer flex arcs -> ferries.]",
